<!-- EPUB/text/ch001.xhtml -->
<section id="section" class="level1 unnumbered">
<h1 class="unnumbered"></h1>
<p>A <a href="https://example.com"> linked body </a> keeps the padding of its content.</p>
<p>A box holds <span class="box"> its own spacing </span> within the line.</p>
<p>An underlined <u> padded body </u> sits beside plain words.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A spaced quotation.</p>
<p>—  A. Author </p>
</blockquote>
<p>A footnote body is trimmed <a href="#fn1" class="footnote-ref" id="fnref1" epub:type="noteref" role="doc-noteref">1</a> here.</p>
<figure>
<p><span></span></p>
<figcaption><p>Figure caption.</p></figcaption>
</figure>
<p>Loop rounds join with their padding: 1 2 3 .</p>
<p>A measurement of 6.0em, a ratio of 50%, and 1.5e-2 exact.</p>
<p><span></span></p>
<p>The binding kept survives its statement.</p>
</section>
<section id="footnotes" class="footnotes footnotes-end-of-document" epub:type="footnotes">
<hr />
<aside epub:type="footnote" role="doc-footnote" id="fn1">
<p>Trimmed on both ends.</p>
</aside>
</section>
